      "hints": [
        "Perpendicular bisector gradient is $\\frac{3}{2} \\implies m_{AB} = -\\frac{2}{3}$.",
        "Form line through $A(-2, 6)$: $y - 6 = -\\frac{2}{3}(x + 2) \\implies 2x + 3y = 14$."
