        "Determine the perpendicular gradient of $AB$:\n$$m_{AB} = -\\frac{1}{3/2} = -\\frac{2}{3}$$",
        "Write the equation of the line $AB$ passing through $A(-2, 6)$:\n$$y - 6 = -\\frac{2}{3}(x - (-2)) \\implies y - 6 = -\\frac{2}{3}(x + 2)$$\n$$2x + 3y = 14 \\quad \\left(\\text{or } y = -\\frac{2}{3}x + \\frac{14}{3}\\right)$$"
      ],
